<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Prague bourse to begin OTC disclosure from March 3.</title>
<headline>Prague bourse to begin OTC disclosure from March 3.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The governing chamber of the Prague Stock Exchange (PSE) agreed on Wednesday it would publish off-market trades conducted by bourse members beginning on March 3.</p>
<p>Spokesman Milan Vodicka told Reuters the PSE was still working out technical details of how to publish the information, which will include the price and volume of each issue traded off-market by bourse members.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
